@startuml 12_InfrastructurePostgres_Sequence
title KnowledgeOS - Infraestructura PostgreSQL - Request Flow
actor Consumer
participant Boundary
participant Coordinator
participant Domain
participant Adapter
Consumer -> Boundary : request + authenticated context
Boundary -> Boundary : validate and authorize
Boundary -> Coordinator : typed input
Coordinator -> Domain : enforce invariants
Domain --> Coordinator : decision
Coordinator -> Adapter : bounded effect
Adapter --> Coordinator : result
Coordinator --> Boundary : typed outcome
Boundary --> Consumer : protocol response
@enduml
